@startuml
left to right direction
actor "Account holder" as Member
actor "Group manager" as Manager
actor "Invitee" as Invitee
actor "Designated reviewer" as Reviewer
rectangle SplitSmart {
  usecase "Register / verify email /\nenroll MFA" as UC1
  usecase "Sign in with password\nand authenticator code" as UC2
  usecase "Use one-time\nrecovery code" as UC3
  usecase "Create/manage group" as UC4
  usecase "Invite/remove members" as UC5
  usecase "Accept invitation" as UC6
  usecase "Submit expense and\noptional receipt" as UC7
  usecase "View in-app notice /\nreceive signed-out email" as UC8
  usecase "Review assigned expense" as UC9
  usecase "View balances /\nrecord payment" as UC10
  usecase "View filtered summaries\nand reports" as UC11
}
Member --> UC1
Member --> UC2
Member --> UC3
Member --> UC4
Manager --> UC5
Invitee --> UC6
Member --> UC7
Member --> UC8
Reviewer --> UC9
Member --> UC10
Member --> UC11
note bottom of UC9
MVP: one manager-designated reviewer,
not the submitter.
end note
note bottom of SplitSmart
Web / Android / iOS are full-product scope;
the Swing MVP does not satisfy those platforms.
end note
@enduml
